# <type>(<scope>): <subject> (max 50 chars, imperative, no period)
#
# Types:
#   feat     - A new feature
#   fix      - A bug fix
#   docs     - Documentation changes
#   style    - Code style / formatting changes (no functional impact)
#   refactor - Refactoring code without behavior change
#   perf     - Performance improvements
#   test     - Adding or updating tests
#   chore    - Build, tooling, dependencies, or maintenance
#   ci       - CI/CD configuration and workflow updates
#
# Common Scopes:
#   backend, frontend, worker, db, escalation, stripe, auth, config, legal
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Why was this change made? (Explain problem/motivation, not just code):
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Footer (e.g. BREAKING CHANGE: <explanation>, Closes #<issue>):

